# ==================================================================
# Clix Church Treasury Management System — persisted PRODUCTION build config
#
# Vite automatically loads this file for any `vite build` (mode defaults
# to "production" unless overridden) — no inline `VITE_API_BASE_URL=...`
# prefix is required on the build command anymore. This is committed to
# git deliberately: it contains no secret (every Vite `VITE_`-prefixed
# variable is bundled into the public JS output regardless — see
# .env.example), and its entire purpose is to be a permanent, version-
# controlled source of truth so the production API URL can never again
# depend on a human remembering to type it correctly at build time.
#
# Root-cause note (incident, production): a build run as plain
# `npm run build` (no inline env var, and no persisted file existed) fell
# through to src/api/client.js's dev-only localhost fallback and baked
# that into the deployed bundle, silently sending the browser to
# `http://localhost:4005`. This file is the permanent fix for that
# failure mode — see docs/DEPLOYMENT.md and docs/SECURITY_ARCHITECTURE.md.
#
# The one and only production domain for this product
# (docs/PROJECT_ARCHITECTURE.md) — never localhost/127.0.0.1/example.com/
# an old Clix project domain here.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://treasurer.clixworks.co.tz/api/v1
